<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK SUBSIDS MAKE Q1 PROFITS.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK SUBSIDS MAKE Q1 PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank on Monday said that its subsidiary companies also made profits during the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>In a statement of consolidated results the bank said that its banking operations made a profit of 96.4 million kroons, Hansa Leasing 21 million kroons, Hansabank-Latvija 6.9 million kroons, Hansa Asset Management 8.4 million kroons and Hansabank Insurance 300,000 kroons.</p>
<p>The bank also saiod its return on equity came to 64.3 percent and its return on assets was 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
